    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Activated Order records with no related blng__BillingSchedule__c.
Why it matters: The order is live but no schedule means no invoices generate — silent revenue stoppage. Often caused by missing billing rule on a product within the order.
Suppress a finding: when the order is intentionally non-billable (free pilot, demo).
Disable the detector: only if you don&apos;t use Salesforce Billing. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
